# secrets
# Defense-in-depth: never commit credentials. Project rule is to keep
# secrets out of the tree entirely; these patterns just stop the obvious
# mistakes (stray .env, copied SSH key, exported credentials.json, ...).
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_ed25519
id_ecdsa
*.kdbx
credentials.json
secrets.json
